__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store

# `.agents/` is tracked here. The global core.excludesFile
# (~/.config/git/ignore) excludes `.agents/` as "local tooling
# configuration", which is right for a scratch `.claude/` and wrong for a
# vendored skill: the repo copy carries this project's local law and is
# useless to anyone who clones without it. `git add` fails silently against a
# global ignore, so the negation has to be stated here — same reasoning as
# Azimuth and Infinite-Verse, which hit this first.
!.agents/
!**/.agents/

